{
  "$comment": [
    "Curated upstream license evidence for H5P libraries, read by",
    "scripts/library-license-inventory.mjs. Keyed by machineName, so an entry",
    "applies to every provisioned version of that library; `checked` is the",
    "date the evidence URL was read.",
    "For a library whose library.json declares NO license, the entry supplies",
    "the license: the inventory reports \"<license> (upstream evidence)\" with",
    "the evidence link instead of \"(none)\".",
    "For a library that DOES declare a license, the entry never changes it; it",
    "records where the Source Code Form lives and any clarification (`note`) —",
    "which is what MPL/GPL redistribution requires the recipient to be told.",
    "The bundled-copyleft scan runs regardless of entries here. Add an entry",
    "only after reading the upstream license text yourself; remove it if",
    "upstream relicenses."
  ],
